{"product_id":"the-battle-for-perfect","title":"the Battle for Perfect","description":"\u003cp\u003eThings have quietened down in the town that used to be Perfect. But stories reach Violet and Boy of five missing scientists. And then they discover something odd in the forest outside Town - a mirror maze hiding a huge castle. Creeping inside, they overhear a terrible plan - a zombie army is about march on Town. Can Violet and Boy save their friends?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Shelf 241\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781474964371\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890737012889,"sku":"14RD9781474964371","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691597becebc0_the_Battle_for_Perfect.jpg?v=1763045057","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-battle-for-perfect","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}